{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkey.ts#L16","children":[{"type":"text","value":"createHotkey.ts:16"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"extends","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extends"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Omit"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HotkeyOptions"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"target\""},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"target","children":[{"type":"text","value":"target?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional target?: Document | Window | HTMLElement | null;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkey.ts#L24","children":[{"type":"text","value":"createHotkey.ts:24"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The DOM element to attach the event listener to.\nCan be a direct DOM element, an accessor (for reactive targets that become\navailable after mount), or null. Defaults to document.\nWhen using scoped targets, pass an accessor: () => ({ target: elementSignal() })\nso the hotkey waits for the element to be attached before registering."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"target","text":"target?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [createHotkey.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkey.ts#L16)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Omit`\\<`HotkeyOptions`, `\"target\"`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### target?\n\n```ts\noptional target?: Document | Window | HTMLElement | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [createHotkey.ts:24](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkey.ts#L24)\n\nThe DOM element to attach the event listener to.\nCan be a direct DOM element, an accessor (for reactive targets that become\navailable after mount), or null. Defaults to document.\nWhen using scoped targets, pass an accessor: () => ({ target: elementSignal() })\nso the hotkey waits for the element to be attached before registering.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: CreateHotkeyOptions\ntitle: CreateHotkeyOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [createHotkey.ts:16](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkey.ts#L16)\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Omit`\\<`HotkeyOptions`, `\"target\"`\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### target?\n\n```ts\noptional target?: Document | Window | HTMLElement | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [createHotkey.ts:24](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/solid-hotkeys/src/createHotkey.ts#L24)\n\nThe DOM element to attach the event listener to.\nCan be a direct DOM element, an accessor (for reactive targets that become\navailable after mount), or null. Defaults to document.\nWhen using scoped targets, pass an accessor: () => ({ target: elementSignal() })\nso the hotkey waits for the element to be attached before registering.\n"}
